TEXT 48 16 Left 3 ;Passkey power and USB front end mockup. No hardware built. Power model only.
TEXT 48 56 Left 2 ;Cable, source, fuse resistance and parasitics are assumptions. See README for every verify item.
TEXT 48 368 Left 2 ;Blimit = ideal 50 mA VBUS inrush limit with 0.1 ohm on resistance. Both values: verify.
TEXT 48 400 Left 2 ;Breg and Binput form an IDEAL behavioral LDO with assumed 2 ms soft start. Not an NCP1117 model.
TEXT 48 432 Left 2 ;Rout = assumed output resistance. Binput draws output current plus assumed 1 mA from VBUS.
TEXT 48 464 Left 2 ;IMCU = MCU and stacked flash proxy. Idle 7.585 mA, active 29.5 mA. ILED = 0.5 mA active. Loads: verify.
TEXT 48 496 Left 2 ;Active total remains 30 mA. No touch load or button. Computer pop up approval is proposed, not simulated.
TEXT 48 576 Left 2 ;USB passive network only
TEXT 48 608 Left 2 ;27 ohm resistors are external.
TEXT 48 640 Left 2 ;Rpu_internal is INSIDE the MCU.
TEXT 48 672 Left 2 ;1.398k is a documented limit,
TEXT 48 704 Left 2 ;not its nominal resistance.
TEXT 48 736 Left 2 ;No external USB pull up is needed.
TEXT 48 768 Left 2 ;1G resistors are numerical references,
TEXT 48 800 Left 2 ;not board parts. No host or packets.
TEXT 960 576 Left 2 ;NON SIMULATED: RP2354A MCU, QFN-60, 7 by 7 mm, 2 MB stacked flash. IMCU is a proxy.
TEXT 960 608 Left 2 ;NON SIMULATED: on chip regulator makes 1.1 V DVDD from 3.3 V.
TEXT 960 640 Left 2 ;Required core support: 3.3 uH AOTA-B201610S3R3-101-T, 4.7 uF input/output/filter, 33 ohm filter.
TEXT 960 672 Left 2 ;Only its 4.7 uF input capacitor is represented above. Core switching and layout are not simulated.
TEXT 960 720 Left 2 ;NON SIMULATED: ABM8-272-T3 12 MHz crystal, two 15 pF capacitors, 1k damping resistor.
TEXT 960 768 Left 2 ;NON SIMULATED SERVICE: QSPI_SS -> 1k -> TP_BOOT. TP_GND -> ground. No surface button.
TEXT 960 800 Left 2 ;Bridge recessed TP_BOOT and TP_GND during power up for BOOTSEL. Service access and boot policy: verify.
TEXT 960 832 Left 2 ;One status LED only. ILED models current, not diode behavior. LED, GPIO, resistor and current: verify.
TEXT 960 864 Left 2 ;NON SIMULATED: FIDO HID, vendor HID, optional boot keyboard, firmware and credential storage.
TEXT 960 912 Left 2 ;Sources: Hardware design with RP2350 sections 2 to 5; RP2350 Datasheet sections 6.3.8 and 14.9.7.3.
TEXT 960 944 Left 2 ;No external flash or Cflash fitted. The 2 MB flash changes the study storage budget of 4 MiB.
TEXT 960 976 Left 2 ;Power results apply only to these ideal models and assumptions. See README before using the file.
TEXT 48 1120 Left 2 !.tran 200n 30m 0 200n
TEXT 48 1160 Left 2 !.meas tran rail_idle AVG V(VDD3V3) FROM=8m TO=9m
TEXT 48 1200 Left 2 !.meas tran rail_active AVG V(VDD3V3) FROM=12m TO=14m
TEXT 48 1240 Left 2 !.meas tran rail_pp PP V(VDD3V3) FROM=9m TO=16m
TEXT 48 1280 Left 2 !.meas tran rail_settled_pp PP V(VDD3V3) FROM=12m TO=14m
TEXT 48 1320 Left 2 !.meas tran vbus_idle AVG V(VBUS_IN) FROM=8m TO=9m
TEXT 48 1360 Left 2 !.meas tran vbus_active AVG V(VBUS_IN) FROM=12m TO=14m
TEXT 48 1400 Left 2 !.meas tran vbus_min MIN V(VBUS_IN) FROM=9m TO=16m
TEXT 1168 1120 Left 2 !.meas tran connector_min MIN V(VBUS_CONN) FROM=9m TO=16m
TEXT 1168 1160 Left 2 !.meas tran connector_droop PARAM='5-connector_min'
TEXT 1168 1200 Left 2 !.meas tran vbus_droop PARAM='5-vbus_min'
TEXT 1168 1240 Left 2 !.meas tran ibus_start_signed MIN I(VBUS) FROM=0 TO=3m
TEXT 1168 1280 Left 2 !.meas tran ibus_active_signed AVG I(VBUS) FROM=12m TO=14m
TEXT 1168 1320 Left 2 !.options reltol=1e-6 abstol=1e-12 vntol=1e-8
TEXT 48 1440 Left 2 ;Plot V(VDD3V3), V(VBUS_CONN) and V(VBUS_IN). rail_pp is the load step excursion, not switching ripple.
TEXT 48 1472 Left 2 ;Stock LTspice symbols only. See check_asc.py and asc-check.txt for connectivity and syntax checks.
